bibindex3 -- what the six published volumes must import
==============================================================================

1  THE 162 ROWS AGAINST THE SIX THAT WILL BE PUBLISHED
   OBJECT            127
   CITED               9
   CITED-FULLER        5
   IMPORT-OWED        21
   and they sum to 162

   bibindex2.py resolved 15 rows into a COMPANION tier.  Under M's scope
   correction that tier is void: Transitions, The Löwdin Solution and The
   Three-Body Problem are not published, so a reader of the six gets nothing
   from them.  Those rows are work owed, not rows resolved.

