4  IMPORT OWED — 21 ROWS, AND WHERE EACH CONTRIBUTION IS ALREADY WRITTEN
   A hit AT THE ROW'S OWN YEAR is a pinned source.  A hit on the author at
   another year is weaker and is marked as such: a first draft of this counted
   both alike and reported Shannon 1937 held, when what it had found was
   Shannon 1948.
   1968  Alekseev                         held in ledger-threebody, thre -> Mathematical Compendium, family 3B (three bodies)
   1974  McGehee                          held in ledger-threebody       -> Mathematical Compendium, family 3B (three bodies)
   1975  Marchal & Saari                  held in ledger-threebody       -> Mathematical Compendium, family 3B (three bodies)
   1976  Monaghan                         held in ledger-threebody, thre -> Mathematical Compendium, family 3B (three bodies)
   1998  Montgomery                       held in ledger-threebody, thre -> Mathematical Compendium, family 3B (three bodies)
   2000  Chenciner & Montgomery           held in ledger-threebody, thre -> Mathematical Compendium, family 3B (three bodies)
   2002  Montgomery                       held in ledger-threebody, thre -> Mathematical Compendium, family 3B (three bodies)
   2019  Fleischer & Knauf                held in ledger-threebody       -> Mathematical Compendium, family 3B (three bodies)
   2021  Kol                              held in ledger-threebody, thre -> Mathematical Compendium, family 3B (three bodies)

